1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,365
Stop scrolling!

2
00:00:01,415 --> 00:00:04,195
Born in the Year of the Tiger?

3
00:00:04,245 --> 00:00:06,742
Your luck isn't good today.

4
00:00:06,792 --> 00:00:09,950
But don't worry, watch to the end.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,469
Today, 25 October, is a Monkey day

6
00:00:12,519 --> 00:00:14,691
and the Tiger sits opposite it

7
00:00:14,741 --> 00:00:16,246
in the zodiac circle.

8
00:00:16,296 --> 00:00:18,320
Some days, things just don't

9
00:00:18,370 --> 00:00:19,950
